	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"圧倒的なスケールでド迫力のタイムマシン登場！",
			"• 全高300mmのド迫力スケール！同時発売のFigure-riseStandard超サイヤ人トランクスが搭乗可能！劇中の再現をトランクスと併せてディスプレイ展開が可能に！",
			"• 内部メカを忠実に再現したこだわりのディテール。内部のメカ構造は本商品の為に新しく公式設定を追加！メカ構造を作りこめるFigure-riseMechanicsならではの商品！",
			"• 外装には劇中登場のHOPE!!の文字をシールで再現！",
			"• 付属品に劇中に登場したセルの抜け殻を付属。劇中に出てきたあのシーンも再現可能に！"
		],
		"en": [
			"A powerful time machine with overwhelming scale appears!",
			"• Impressive Scale with a total height of 300mm! Simultaneously released Figure-rise Standard Super Saiyan Trunks can be boarded! It is now possible to display the reproduction from the play along with the trunks!",
			"• Attention to detail that faithfully reproduces the internal mechanism. The internal mechanical structure has new official settings added for this product! A product unique to Figure-riseMechanics that allows you to create mechanical structures!",
			"• On the exterior, the words HOPE!! that appear in the movie are reproduced with Seal!",
			"• A shell of the cell that appeared in the movie is included as an accessory. You can also recreate the scenes that appeared in the movie!"
		]
	},
